{"id":41,"slug":"bottle","name":"魔瓶","en":"Bottle","cost":675,"qual":"common","category":"basic","categoryLabel":"基础装备","neutralTier":null,"img":"assets/items/bottle.png","desc":"<div class=\"tt-h\">使用：恢复</div>每次使用都能在2.7秒内恢复110点生命与60点魔法。受到来自敌方英雄或肉山的攻击会失去恢复效果。<br><br>魔瓶在靠近友方泉水时会被灌满。<br><br>按住Ctrl键可以对友军施放。\n\n<div class=\"tt-h\">被动：储存神符</div>右键点击神符可以将其存入魔瓶内留作备用，90秒后神符未被使用将会自动激活。<br><br>使用储存的神符后魔瓶将会被灌满。","lore":"一个流传至今的古老瓶子，内部空间随着时间的流逝逐渐拥有魔力。","notes":["魔瓶可以共享。储存的神符无法共享。","使用储存的赏金或圣水神符后，若储存时魔瓶被灌满时，那么魔瓶还会被灌满；否则将灌至两口。"],"values":[{"key":"health_restore","label":"生命回复","value":"110"},{"key":"mana_restore","label":"魔法恢复","value":"60"},{"key":"max_charges","label":"最大能量点数","value":"3"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"0.5 秒"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"350"}],"components":[],"buildsInto":[],"short":"生命回复 110 · 魔法恢复 60","aliases":[],"heroes":[{"slug":"puck","name":"帕克","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/puck.png","count":98,"heat":100},{"slug":"tinker","name":"修补匠","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/tinker.png","count":98,"heat":100},{"slug":"ember_spirit","name":"灰烬之灵","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/ember_spirit.png","count":98,"heat":100},{"slug":"void_spirit","name":"虚无之灵","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/void_spirit.png","count":98,"heat":100},{"slug":"queenofpain","name":"痛苦女王","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/queenofpain.png","count":96,"heat":97.96},{"slug":"storm_spirit","name":"风暴之灵","icon":"assets/heroes/icons/storm_spirit.png","count":94,"heat":95.92}]}